# Explicit curation guardrails.
# Root shared infrastructure is excluded from the AI category; explicit
# service endpoints remain available in the source lists.
# IP-ASN entries are dropped from every category: a whole cloud-provider ASN
# is too broad to pin to one service (WeChat's IP-ASN,132203 force-DIRECTed
# every Tencent Cloud tenant, breaking api.assrt.net behind the censor).
